cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software artifact when referring to its checked Lean statements.
  Consult COVERAGE.md for the distinction between the formalized results and
  the accompanying manuscript.
type: software
title: Lean proofs for analog moment computation
authors:
  - family-names: Razavikia
    given-names: Saeed
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization accompanying Geometric Optimization of Continuous Encoders
  for Moment-Based Computation. The artifact includes checked results on operational
  scores, coefficient-class encoder design, decoding, small-noise limits, and
  Gram frontiers. Unrestricted continuous-encoder rigidity and other manuscript
  results remain incomplete; the coverage documents state the exact scope.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - over-the-air computation
  - analog encoders
repository-code: https://github.com/SaeedRazavikia/Optimal-Continuous-Analog-Encoders-TIT-
